<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληκ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of, for,</i> or <i>by striking,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θήρα</span> fishing <i>by means of
				spearing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				220d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πληκτική, τὸ πληκτικόν
			[μέρος</span>], ib.<i><span class="en">
				220e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				221b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ready to strike, given to striking,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. [ὁ σκορπίος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				331
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ ἀνδρὸς . . πληκτικώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					608b10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>striking the senses, overpowering,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος, τροφή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.27a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ ὀσμῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.125
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); of whitewashed rooms, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.13.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span>”
				<i>overpowering effect,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.693b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				367c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				735d
			</span></i> (cj.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>striking the mind, impressive, startling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.71
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				240
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Sens.</u>
					104.16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ulp.
			</span></i> ad <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.56
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.462
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τλητ-</span>).</div>
